OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire warning issued after
OL,4,Abarbecue bin blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn urgent warning about the continued
OL,7,Frisk of wildfires has been issued,
OL,8,Fafter a bin blaze caused by a
OL,9,Fdisposable barbecue.
OL,11,FThe fire in a public bin at Alnmouth
OL,12,Fbeach "could easily have spread"
OL,13,Fcausing damage to the environment and
OL,14,Fwildlife, according to Northumberland
OL,15,FFire and Rescue Service.
OL,17,FLast year, a serious wildfire that
OL,18,Fcaused widespread devastation at nearby
OL,19,FDruridge Bay was believed to be caused
OL,20,Fby a barbecue or campfire.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
