OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire warning issued after
OL,4,Abarbecue bin blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service spokesperson urged the
OL,7,Fpublic to help "keep Northumberland
OL,8,Fsafe": "With temperatures remaining
OL,9,Fvery high across Northumberland, the
OL,10,Frisk of wildfire is increased."
